<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43591" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐδαιμον-ία</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιη</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>prosperity, good fortune,
				opulence,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				h.Hom.
				11.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				7.56
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.5
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				32
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				11
			</span></i> (v.l.), etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρημάτων προσόδῳ καὶ
				τῇ ἄλλῃ εὐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.97
			</span></i>; of countries, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				7.220
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μοῖρ᾽ εὐδαιμονίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					3.84
				</span></i>
			: pl., <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IA</u>
				591
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				115d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>true, full happiness</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐ. οὐκ ἐν βοσκήμασιν οἰκεῖ οὐδ᾽ ἐν
					χρυσῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Democr.
					171
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐ. ψυχῆς</span>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακοδαιμονίη</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				170
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Def.</u>
				412d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1095a18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Zeno Stoic.
				1.46
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			personified as a divinity, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				985.8
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Philadelphia</span>).</div>
